{
 "npcs": {
  "rook": {
   "id": "rook",
   "name": "Mother Rook",
   "title": "Keeper of the Last Lamp",
   "role": "Innkeeper",
   "model": "barbarian",
   "show": [
    "Mug"
   ],
   "tint": "#8a5a6a",
   "scale": 0.95,
   "idle": "Idle_FoldArms_Loop",
   "person": {
    "sex": "female",
    "outfit": [
     "Female_Peasant_Arms",
     "Female_Peasant_Body",
     "Female_Peasant_Legs",
     "Female_Peasant_Feet"
    ],
    "hair": "Hair_Buns",
    "hairColor": "#7a746e",
    "skin": "#e0a47c",
    "figure": 1.2,
    "dye": {
     "cloth": "#8a5a6a",
     "under": "#3a2a2a"
    }
   },
   "spot": {
    "x": -11.2,
    "z": 12.6,
    "facing": 1.5707963267948966
   },
   "barks": [
    "Beds are dry and the stew's hot. That's more than most can say.",
    "Wipe your boots.",
    "If you're bleeding, bleed outside.",
    "Rooms upstairs by the night. By the hour, ask Sella."
   ],
   "nightBarks": [
    "Lamps stay lit till the last one's in.",
    "Bed's warm if you want it. Stew's gone.",
    "Quietly, now. People are sleeping.",
    "Going up to Sella's? Wipe your boots twice. She's particular about her floor and nothing else."
   ],
   "said": [
    {
     "text": "Harlan's not eating. I've sent bread. He's sent it back.",
     "night": false,
     "when": {
      "fact": "caravan.survivors",
      "eq": "dead"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Hook's empty. I know. Leave it.",
     "night": false,
     "when": {
      "fact": "nell.buried",
      "eq": true
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Lamp burned all night for you, pet. A night's ember. It's on your slate.",
     "night": true,
     "when": {
      "all": [
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.ago",
        "eq": 0
       },
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.past",
        "gte": 5
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Face like a wet week. Eat first. It'll still be there after.",
     "night": false,
     "when": {
      "all": [
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.ago",
        "eq": 1
       },
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.story",
        "eq": true
       },
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.won",
        "eq": false
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Sit down before you fall down. Again.",
     "night": false,
     "when": {
      "all": [
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.ago",
        "eq": 1
       },
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.fell",
        "eq": true
       }
      ]
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  "holloway": {
   "id": "holloway",
   "name": "Captain Holloway",
   "title": "Of the Waystation Watch",
   "role": "Watch captain",
   "model": "knight",
   "show": [
    "1H_Sword",
    "Rectangle_Shield",
    "Knight_Cape"
   ],
   "tint": "#9aa8c0",
   "idle": "Idle_FoldArms_Loop",
   "person": {
    "sex": "male",
    "outfit": [
     "Male_Ranger_Arms",
     "Male_Ranger_Body",
     "Male_Ranger_Legs",
     "Male_Ranger_Feet_Boots",
     "Male_Ranger_Acc_Pauldron"
    ],
    "hair": "Hair_Buzzed",
    "hairColor": "#4a4038",
    "beard": true,
    "skin": "#e0a47c",
    "dye": {
     "cloth": "#56627e"
    }
   },
   "spot": {
    "x": -3.6,
    "z": -9.5,
    "facing": 0.6
   },
   "barks": [
    "Keep to the road, and keep your blade where I can see it.",
    "Three caravans this month. Three."
   ],
   "nightBarks": [
    "Curfew's not law. Yet.",
    "Two on the walls, one on each gate. It's not enough.",
    "Go to bed, traveller.",
    "Every night I bury somebody's son. Go home.",
    "Quiet on the wall. I hate it quiet."
   ],
   "said": [
    {
     "text": "Five a pelt. Fifty for the old grey one.",
     "night": false,
     "when": {
      "not": {
       "fact": "beasts.outcome",
       "exists": true
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Pelt book's closed. I'll not miss writing in it.",
     "night": false,
     "when": {
      "all": [
       {
        "fact": "beasts.outcome",
        "exists": true
       },
       {
        "not": {
         "fact": "beasts.outcome",
         "eq": "ignored"
        }
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Corran's in the ground. That's one debt paid.",
     "night": false,
     "when": {
      "fact": "corran.home",
      "eq": true
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "One caravan home. I'll take it.",
     "night": false,
     "when": {
      "fact": "caravan.survivors",
      "eq": "rescued"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "One in. Count's right, for once.",
     "night": true,
     "when": {
      "fact": "arena.last.ago",
      "eq": 0
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Heard you put down what rules out there. Proof it can be done.",
     "night": false,
     "when": {
      "all": [
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.ago",
        "eq": 1
       },
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.won",
        "eq": true
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Seven nights out, seven back. I've taken you out of the missing column.",
     "night": false,
     "once": true,
     "when": {
      "all": [
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.ago",
        "eq": 1
       },
       {
        "fact": "arena.nights",
        "gte": 7
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Count was one short last night. It's right this morning. Don't make me write it twice.",
     "night": false,
     "when": {
      "all": [
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.ago",
        "eq": 1
       },
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.story",
        "eq": true
       },
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.won",
        "eq": false
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Had Redcowl on his knee and let him up. Road's quiet. I'll give you that.",
     "night": false,
     "when": {
      "fact": "redcowl",
      "eq": "spared"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Ninety-one up.",
     "night": true,
     "when": {
      "fact": "holloway.confessed",
      "eq": true
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  "maeca": {
   "id": "maeca",
   "name": "Maeca",
   "title": "Hunter, of the Hollow",
   "role": "Hunter",
   "model": "rogue",
   "show": [
    "1H_Crossbow",
    "Rogue_Cape"
   ],
   "tint": "#6a7a4a",
   "idle": "Idle_B",
   "person": {
    "sex": "female",
    "outfit": [
     "Female_Ranger_Arms",
     "Female_Ranger_Body",
     "Female_Ranger_Legs",
     "Female_Ranger_Feet"
    ],
    "hair": "Hair_Long",
    "hairColor": "#2a1a12",
    "skin": "#c4945e",
    "figure": 0.8,
    "dye": {
     "cloth": "#4a5a36"
    }
   },
   "spot": {
    "x": 33.5,
    "z": 3.6,
    "facing": -1.5707963267948966
   },
   "barks": [
    "Mind the east road after dark."
   ],
   "nightBarks": [
    "Hear that? No. Neither do I. That's what worries me.",
    "One more, then I sleep."
   ],
   "said": [
    {
     "text": "They're not hunting. They're running.",
     "night": false,
     "when": {
      "not": {
       "fact": "beasts.outcome",
       "exists": true
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Something's got the whole wood on edge.",
     "night": false,
     "when": {
      "not": {
       "fact": "beasts.outcome",
       "exists": true
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "The Pack's loud tonight.",
     "night": true,
     "when": {
      "not": {
       "fact": "beasts.outcome",
       "eq": "slaughtered"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Somewhere out there an old wolf's coughing. Listen.",
     "night": true,
     "when": {
      "not": {
       "fact": "beasts.outcome",
       "exists": true
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Hear that? They're hunting again. Deer.",
     "night": true,
     "when": {
      "fact": "beasts.outcome",
      "eq": "cured"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "The Pack's lying up by the east wall. Leave them be.",
     "night": true,
     "when": {
      "fact": "beasts.outcome",
      "eq": "allied"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Nothing calls in the Hollow now.",
     "night": true,
     "when": {
      "fact": "beasts.outcome",
      "eq": "slaughtered"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Heard you out by the Hollow last night. From the Blind. How many?",
     "night": false,
     "when": {
      "all": [
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.ago",
        "eq": 1
       },
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.people",
        "eq": "pack"
       },
       {
        "not": {
         "fact": "beasts.outcome",
         "exists": true
        }
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Mine don't run at fire. Whatever came at you last night wasn't mine.",
     "night": false,
     "when": {
      "all": [
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.ago",
        "eq": 1
       },
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.people",
        "eq": "pack"
       },
       {
        "any": [
         {
          "fact": "beasts.outcome",
          "eq": "cured"
         },
         {
          "fact": "beasts.outcome",
          "eq": "allied"
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "There's no Pack left. I counted the pelts. So what were you killing?",
     "night": false,
     "when": {
      "all": [
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.ago",
        "eq": 1
       },
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.people",
        "eq": "pack"
       },
       {
        "fact": "beasts.outcome",
        "eq": "slaughtered"
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "That's his. Wear it where I can't see it.",
     "when": {
      "hasTag": "greymuzzle_fang"
     },
     "once": true,
     "effects": [
      {
       "rel": {
        "npc": "maeca",
        "affection": -10
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Heard you go down in the Hollow. Heard them walk away after. They don't leave meat.",
     "night": false,
     "when": {
      "all": [
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.ago",
        "eq": 1
       },
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.story",
        "eq": true
       },
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.won",
        "eq": false
       },
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.people",
        "eq": "pack"
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Heard you let the red one walk. ...Good.",
     "night": false,
     "when": {
      "fact": "redcowl",
      "eq": "spared"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  "chid": {
   "id": "chid",
   "name": "Chid",
   "title": "\"The Fool\", of the Morning Light",
   "role": "Priest",
   "model": "mage",
   "show": [
    "Spellbook"
   ],
   "tint": "#d8ccb0",
   "idle": "Idle",
   "person": {
    "sex": "male",
    "outfit": [
     "Male_Peasant_Arms",
     "Male_Peasant_Body",
     "Male_Peasant_Legs",
     "Male_Peasant_Feet"
    ],
    "hair": "Hair_SimpleParted",
    "hairColor": "#8a6a3a",
    "dye": {
     "cloth": "#d8ccb0"
    }
   },
   "spot": {
    "x": -20.6,
    "z": -20.8,
    "facing": 0.7853981633974483
   },
   "barks": [
    "The light's patient. I'm trying to be.",
    "Morning comes. It always has. I should know."
   ],
   "nightBarks": [
    "Even in the dark, the morning's on its way.",
    "I leave a candle lit. Somebody might need it.",
    "Can't sleep either?",
    "The dark's only the part of the day that hasn't happened yet. ...It's taking its time tonight."
   ],
   "said": [
    {
     "text": "It used to work, you know. The shrine.",
     "night": false,
     "when": {
      "not": {
       "fact": "shrine.lit",
       "eq": true
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "It works! It works. I keep checking.",
     "night": false,
     "when": {
      "fact": "shrine.lit",
      "eq": true
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Up and about! Up's very good.",
     "night": false,
     "when": {
      "fact": "player.deaths",
      "gte": 1
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Two candles in for her. One's for Brannoc. He'd only blow it out.",
     "night": true,
     "when": {
      "fact": "nell.buried",
      "eq": true
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Oh, you're cold! Colder than usual, I mean. Come and sit by the flame.",
     "night": true,
     "once": true,
     "when": {
      "all": [
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.ago",
        "eq": 0
       },
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.fell",
        "eq": true
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Back again! You always are. Sit, sit; the flame likes company.",
     "night": true,
     "when": {
      "all": [
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.ago",
        "eq": 0
       },
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.fell",
        "eq": true
       },
       {
        "fact": "arena.fell",
        "gte": 2
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Out ever so long! The whole dark was up, like moths round a candle.",
     "night": true,
     "once": true,
     "when": {
      "all": [
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.ago",
        "eq": 0
       },
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.past",
        "gte": 15
       }
      ]
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  "rav": {
   "id": "rav",
   "name": "Rav Cutwell",
   "title": "Late of the Kerchiefs",
   "role": "Physician, of a sort",
   "model": "rogue_hooded",
   "show": [
    "Knife"
   ],
   "tint": "#8a3a34",
   "idle": "Sit_Chair_Idle",
   "person": {
    "sex": "male",
    "outfit": [
     "Male_Peasant_Arms",
     "Male_Peasant_Body",
     "Male_Peasant_Legs",
     "Male_Peasant_Feet",
     "Male_Ranger_Head_Hood"
    ],
    "hair": null,
    "beard": true,
    "hairColor": "#5a4a3a",
    "skin": "#e0a47c",
    "dye": {
     "cloth": "#8a3a34",
     "under": "#2a1a18"
    }
   },
   "arms": {
    "right": "dagger_b"
   },
   "spot": {
    "x": -11.4,
    "z": -7.6,
    "facing": 1.5707963267948966
   },
   "barks": [
    "I'm a doctor. Don't make me prove it.",
    "Red cloth's a hard habit to break.",
    "Buy me a drink and I'll tell you a lie worth hearing.",
    "Drop your trousers or don't. The leeches aren't fussy.",
    "Half my patients die. The other half pay.",
    "Pox, piles, a pike-wound or a broken heart: I've a cure for three of them and a drink for the fourth."
   ],
   "nightBarks": [
    "Night surgery's double. Night anything's double.",
    "The best stories come after the third cup.",
    "Pull up a stool. Mind the blood.",
    "Last orders were an hour ago. I'm the only one who heard them."
   ],
   "said": [
    {
     "text": "Man owed me a leg, pal. Bad debt, now.",
     "night": true,
     "when": {
      "fact": "redcowl",
      "eq": "dead"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Red on your sleeve, pal, and it's not yours. Don't tell me whose.",
     "night": false,
     "when": {
      "all": [
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.ago",
        "eq": 1
       },
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.people",
        "eq": "kerchiefs"
       },
       {
        "not": {
         "fact": "redcowl",
         "eq": "dead"
        }
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Red on your sleeve again. There's not enough Kerchiefs left to bleed like that.",
     "night": false,
     "when": {
      "all": [
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.ago",
        "eq": 1
       },
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.people",
        "eq": "kerchiefs"
       },
       {
        "fact": "redcowl",
        "eq": "dead"
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Back on your feet. Doctor's orders: drink, then fall over somewhere soft.",
     "night": true,
     "when": {
      "all": [
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.ago",
        "eq": 0
       },
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.fell",
        "eq": true
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Heard the lads laid you out proper. Hands crossed and all. That's manners, from them.",
     "night": false,
     "when": {
      "all": [
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.ago",
        "eq": 1
       },
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.story",
        "eq": true
       },
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.won",
        "eq": false
       },
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.people",
        "eq": "kerchiefs"
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Quiet up the ruts, these nights. I don't miss the trade.",
     "night": false,
     "when": {
      "fact": "redcowl",
      "eq": "spared"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  "harlan": {
   "id": "harlan",
   "name": "Harlan Coyle",
   "title": "Of the Coyle Company",
   "role": "Merchant",
   "model": "barbarian",
   "show": [],
   "tint": "#a0784a",
   "idle": "Idle_Talking_Loop",
   "person": {
    "sex": "male",
    "outfit": [
     "Male_Peasant_Arms",
     "Male_Peasant_Body",
     "Male_Peasant_Legs",
     "Male_Peasant_Feet"
    ],
    "hair": "Hair_SimpleParted",
    "hairColor": "#5e3e28",
    "beard": true,
    "skin": "#e0a47c",
    "dye": {
     "cloth": "#a0784a",
     "under": "#3a2a1c"
    }
   },
   "spot": {
    "x": 10.4,
    "z": -10.4,
    "facing": -1.5707963267948966
   },
   "barks": [
    "Salt and iron, friend. Good honest salt."
   ],
   "nightBarks": [
    "I keep the books by candlelight. Helps me not think."
   ],
   "said": [
    {
     "text": "Late. Jory's never late.",
     "night": false,
     "when": {
      "not": {
       "fact": "caravan.survivors",
       "exists": true
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Salt, iron, cloth. Whatever you need, when the wagons come.",
     "night": false,
     "when": {
      "not": {
       "fact": "caravan.survivors",
       "exists": true
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Somebody knows something.",
     "night": false,
     "when": {
      "not": {
       "fact": "caravan.survivors",
       "exists": true
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Every wagon on that road's his, in the dark.",
     "night": true,
     "when": {
      "not": {
       "fact": "caravan.survivors",
       "eq": "rescued"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Can't sleep. Won't.",
     "night": true,
     "when": {
      "not": {
       "fact": "caravan.survivors",
       "exists": true
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Jory hated the dark. Hated it. Slept with a candle till he was fourteen.",
     "night": true,
     "when": {
      "not": {
       "fact": "caravan.survivors",
       "eq": "rescued"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Jory's asleep in Rook's good room. I keep going to look.",
     "night": false,
     "when": {
      "fact": "caravan.survivors",
      "eq": "rescued"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "He sleeps with the lamp lit. So do I, now.",
     "night": true,
     "when": {
      "fact": "caravan.survivors",
      "eq": "rescued"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Coyle and Nephew, the new sign was going to say. Coyle and—",
     "night": false,
     "when": {
      "fact": "caravan.survivors",
      "eq": "dead"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Mister Coyle, he calls me. In my own shop.",
     "night": false,
     "when": {
      "fact": "jory.knows_be",
      "eq": true
     }
    }
   ]
  },
