       {
        "fact": "arena.last.ago",
        "eq": 1
       },
       {
        "fact": "arena.last.fell",
        "eq": true
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "They say the dead carried you back out of the old door. The dead do not, as a rule, give anything back. ...I am making a note.",
